OL,3,GNEWSAAbuse of patients 'dark chapter'
OL,4,Ain history of care at hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the Belfast Health Trust
OL,7,Fhas expressed "deep shame" over the
OL,8,Fabuse of patients at Muckamore Abbey
OL,9,FHospital in County Antrim.
OL,11,FGiving evidence to Stormont's health
OL,12,Fcommittee, Jennifer Welsh said the
OL,13,Fscandal had been a "dark chapter" in
OL,14,Fthe history of caring for vulnerable
OL,15,Fadults in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
