OL,3,GNEWSAAbuse of patients 'dark chapter'
OL,4,Ain history of care at hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public inquiry into abuse at the
OL,7,Ffacility for people with mental health
OL,8,Fconditions and learning disabilities
OL,9,Ffound some patients suffered physical
OL,10,Fabuse, including black eyes, broken
OL,11,Fbones, bruising and excessive
OL,12,Frestraint.
OL,14,FWelsh said the impact of the inquiry
OL,15,Freport was "illuminating a rot that
OL,16,Fpermeated deep into a culture and a way
OL,17,Fof life at Muckamore that was
OL,18,Fsystemic".
